
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_REORGANIZE_RFPAB]
Reorganize RFPAB

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_REORGANIZE_RFPAB_desc]
The Public Affairs Bureau of the Rock Farm had long been under Limestone Pie’s control. Perhaps they had made many important contributions to the peace and stability of the farm? Maud Pie wasn’t entirely sure.\nHowever, she knew it was absolutely necessary for her to take charge of the bureau once again — and maybe, along the way, she could also see how her sister had managed things before.

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_REORGANIZE_RFPAB]
改组公共事务局

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_REORGANIZE_RFPAB_desc]
采石农场的公共事务局此前都由石青派来掌控，也许他们为采石农场的和平和稳定做出了许多重要的贡献？石灰派对此也不是非常清楚，但是，由她来重新掌控这个机构是十分必要的，同时也可以看看她的姐姐之前是怎么做的
